<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kanto’s Power Plant?\rEnd of Route 9, east from here.\rI heard there was some kinda\n“accident.” The air quotes is\fimportant.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You collectin’ EVERY kinda homie?\rThat’s a challenge. That’s a lifestyle.\nThat’s how my uncle ended up with 40\fcats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The cape up north is THE date spot.\nGirls LOVE it!\rBetween you and me... Misty, the Block\nBoss, be out at the cape sometimes.\rI been goin’ every day for a year.\nShe ain’t noticed me once.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWBRO: Yarah?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWBRO is HYPE to scrap!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My SLOWBRO and me make a\nhard combo!\rSLOWBRO, show me your Chain Swing!\r...!\nSLOWBRO’s Chain Swing hit HARD!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This SHADY dude asked me how to get to\nthe Power Plant.\rHe said it gotta stay “...classified.”\nThen he asked me for bus fare.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shady character snuck into the\nBlock! What business he got with\fMisty?!\fI’M the one with business with Misty!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I saw a shady dude in black go toward\nthe Cape. He was doin’ a lil sneaky\fwalk.\fLike a cartoon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m a HUGE fan of Misty from the\nCerulean Block. I got her poster.\fThree of ’em.\fOne on the ceilin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I heard about a cave here with SCARY\nstrong homies. That’s why I came.\rI’m scared, but I came. That’s\ncourage. Or stupidity.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayuh?\rMy Dowsing Machine goin’ off...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This is...\nThe notorious Cerulean Cave!\rScary strong homies live here.\nOnly people who beat all eight\fKanto Block Bosses can\fgo in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cerulean City\nThe Floral Lagoon City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cerulean City Block\nBoss: Misty\fCalls Everybody a Pest.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Trendsetter of the Bike Boom\rCerulean Bike Main Shop</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a notice here...\rStop stealin’ and make the city\na friendlier, happier place!\fCerulean Police</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 24 Ahead\nEast to Cerulean Cape</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0467_T04_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s locked...</language>
	</row>
</body>
